    {
      "source": "Returns the required <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> or throws\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> if no converter is available.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> 所需的转换器，或者在不可用任何转换器时抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> that delegates conversion to the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>s.",
      "translation": "一个委托转换给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/BiFunction.html\" title=\"类或接口在 java.util.function\"><code>BiFunction</code></a>s 的<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> applicable for the given <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取适用于给定<a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>的<a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"../PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> registered for the given <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>property</code></a>.",
